QFWN7g","date":"2018-11-05T20:56:05","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9266866445541382,"text_excerpt":"There's a new sweet shop on Magazine and this could get dangerous. I had been pretty much stalking the opening of this place since I heard it was happening. I love Haydel's pastries, but I never get out to Jefferson to have any. In fact, I think I have really only had them at events. Being able to pop in and get some yummies to go was an exciting prospect. I stopped in today and the shop is adorable. They have some good treats such as full cakes, cake bars, petit fours, croissants, muffins, eclairs and a few other sweet indulgences. They also serve French Market coffee, so you can get some caffeine to really make all of the sugar pop. I got a blueberry muffin and a petit four. Both were o..."},{"business_id":"GcJsCFzqvVVwydvBcxmJIA","review_id":"yNIuYUkJeCgqNPoQ4KD_Pw","date":"2019-01-31T19:51:30","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9225519299507141,"text_excerpt":"I needed a king cake, stat! So I ran by this new outpost of Haydel's Bakery on a Saturday evening. They had beaucoup king cakes and so many other adorable items, plus coffee, hot chocolate, what not. It's a small shop but with it's gleaming surfaces and white color scheme it's very inviting. I like that there was a clear way to queue up to order your pastries/bevs/whatever. Service was quick and my black & gold robbed cookie was delicious, as was the king cake!"},{"business_id":"GcJsCFzqvVVwydvBcxmJIA","review_id":"1u46f2GGz8lme7WaEfhZMQ","date":"2020-01-12T16:17:25","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9213559627532959,"text_excerpt":"I woke up early this morning craving King Cake so I made an early morning trip to Haydel's!! The King Cake was amazing!! Fresh and moist, with the perfect amount of cinnamon and flavor. The bakery is really cute with French Market coffee and all kinds of delicious, enticing pastries-it was hard not to buy them but I was sooo happy with my King Cake!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"GcJsCFzqvVVwydvBcxmJIA","photo_id":"cDfgedJEP0pAMWNCI_CQTg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/cDfgedJEP0pAMWNCI_CQTg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9203863143920898},{"business_id":"GcJsCFzqvVVwydvBcxmJIA","photo_id":"5L_q-HY1lUwpIIJWCZUYkw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/5L_q-HY1lUwpIIJWCZUYkw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8909307718276978},{"business_id":"GcJsCFzqvVVwydvBcxmJIA","photo_id":"6cJaBzg-rljnBMSJhW92NA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/6cJaBzg-rljnBMSJhW92NA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7770199179649353},{"business_id":"GcJsCFzqvVVwydvBcxmJIA","photo_id":"ISsGLzyVmzBTR9JQ23g2Rg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/ISsGLzyVmzBTR9JQ23g2Rg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7428537607192993}]},"notebook_case":null}
